### Create a discount list
POST {{baseUrl}}/discount_lists
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Summer Discounts",
  "is_active": true,
  "is_default": false,
  "valid_from": "2026-06-01T00:00:00Z",
  "valid_to": "2026-09-30T23:59:59Z"
}

### Get a discount list by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/discount_lists/1
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### List discount lists
GET {{baseUrl}}/discount_lists?page_size=10&page_id=0
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### Create a discount list item
POST {{baseUrl}}/discount_lists/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "discount_list_id": 1,
  "product_id": 1,
  "discount": 15
}

### List discount list items
GET {{baseUrl}}/discount_lists/1/items
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### Delete a discount list item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/discount_lists/1/items/1
Authorization: bearer {{token}}
